  message: "P4 REVIEW 2026-11-01 (dev 9ae4abe13f; owner-requested re-check of open P4 items last modified before 2026-10-20; fixtures under ~/hypergumbo_lab_notebook/p4_review_11012026/tool1/). VERDICT: PARTLY-STALE. Reviewed 2026-11-01 at dev 9ae4abe13f. The stated gate 'until the selector itself is trusted (Phase 2+)' has been met in form: Phase 2 union is default-on (scripts/smart-test:136 SELECT_UNION=true, 87fd5329a7 2026-08-17) and Phase 3 narrowing is opt-in --narrow (1ee9984304, WI-bolot done). WI-bolot's closure recorded that the cycle-time premise behind both phases was wrong. No .githooks file invokes smart-test or coverage-select. The item stays a governance-gated nicety; what is out of date is its deferral reason. MECHANISM: deferral condition was keyed to a selector phase (Phase 2+) that has since shipped, while the item's own argument (a hook changes only when selection runs) still holds."  # 2cb6
